buckets for Debian
==================

This package provides the buckets CLI tool for game asset and expectation management.

Building the Package
--------------------

To build the Debian package, you have several options:

1. Using the build script:
   ```
   ./build-deb.sh
   ```

2. Using the Makefile:
   ```
   make -f Makefile.deb deb
   ```

3. Using dpkg-buildpackage directly:
   ```
   dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc -b
   ```

Prerequisites
-------------

Before building, ensure you have the following installed:
- Rust toolchain (cargo, rustc)
- dpkg-dev
- debhelper (>= 13)
- devscripts
- pkg-config
- libssl-dev

Install all dependencies with:
```
sudo apt-get install dpkg-dev debhelper devscripts cargo rustc pkg-config libssl-dev
```

Installation
------------

After building, install the package with:
```
sudo dpkg -i ../buckets_*.deb
```

If there are dependency issues, fix them with:
```
sudo apt-get install -f
```

Uninstallation
--------------

To remove the package:
```
sudo apt-get remove buckets
```

To remove the package and its configuration files:
```
sudo apt-get purge buckets
```

